<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <title>Assignment 2 - HTML</title>
</head>

<body>

    <!-- =====================================================
         QUESTION 1: Create a basic webpage
         ===================================================== -->

    <h1>Aryan Rastogi</h1>

    <p>
        Hello! My name is Aryan Rastogi. I am a Computer Science student
        interested in programming, web development, and technology.
    </p>


    <!-- =====================================================
         QUESTION 2: Add a hyperlink to Google
         ===================================================== -->

    <a href="https://www.google.com" target="_blank">
        Visit Google
    </a>


    <!-- =====================================================
         QUESTION 3: Insert an image
         ===================================================== -->

    <br><br>

    <img src="https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/0/05/Doraemon_character.png"
         alt="Doraemon cartoon character">


    <!-- =====================================================
         QUESTION 4: Paragraph describing favorite hobby
         ===================================================== -->

    <p>
        My favorite hobby is <strong>coding</strong> because it allows me
        to solve problems and create useful applications. I find programming
        very <em>interesting</em> and enjoyable.
    </p>


    <!-- =====================================================
         QUESTION 5: Paragraph with two sentences using <br>
         ===================================================== -->

    <p>
        I enjoy learning new programming concepts.<br>
        I practice coding regularly to improve my skills.
    </p>


    <!-- =====================================================
         QUESTION 6: Blockquote with author
         ===================================================== -->

    <blockquote>
        "The only way to do great work is to love what you do."
        <cite>Steve Jobs</cite>
    </blockquote>


    <!-- =====================================================
         QUESTION 7: Different heading levels
         ===================================================== -->

    <h1>Aryan Rastogi</h1>
    <h2>Computer Science Student</h2>
    <h3>Programming and Web Development</h3>


    <!-- =====================================================
         QUESTION 8: Mark and Small elements
         ===================================================== -->

    <p>
        Learning <mark>programming</mark> is an important part of my education.
        <small>Updated recently</small>
    </p>


    <!-- =====================================================
         QUESTION 9: Strong and Emphasis
         ===================================================== -->

    <p>
        It is <strong>very important</strong> to practice coding
        <em>regularly</em> to become a better programmer.
    </p>


    <!-- =====================================================
         QUESTION 10: Inline code
         ===================================================== -->

    <p>
        In JavaScript, you can display Hello World using
        <code>console.log("Hello World");</code>
    </p>


    <!-- =====================================================
         QUESTION 11: Three span elements
         ===================================================== -->

    <p>
        <span>Student</span> -
        <span>Programmer</span> -
        <span>Web Developer</span>
    </p>


    <!-- =====================================================
         QUESTION 12: Creative paragraph with inline elements
         ===================================================== -->

    <p>
        <strong>Welcome to my webpage!</strong>
        I am <em>passionate</em> about
        <mark>technology and programming</mark>.<br>
        <small>Thank you for visiting my page.</small>
    </p>


    <!-- =====================================================
         QUESTION 13: Header section
         ===================================================== -->

    <header>
        <h1>Aryan's Website</h1>
    </header>


    <!-- =====================================================
         QUESTION 14: Navigation section with three links
         ===================================================== -->

    <nav>
        <a href="#">Home</a>
        <a href="#">About</a>
        <a href="#">Contact</a>
    </nav>


    <!-- =====================================================
         QUESTION 15: Main section
         ===================================================== -->

    <main>

        <p>
            Hello! I am Aryan Rastogi, a Computer Science student.
            This webpage contains information about me, my interests,
            and my activities.
        </p>


        <!-- =================================================
             QUESTION 16: About Me section
             ================================================= -->

        <section>
            <h2>About Me</h2>

            <p>
                I am a Computer Science student interested in programming,
                web development, data analysis, and learning new technologies.
            </p>
        </section>


        <!-- =================================================
             QUESTION 17: Article - My First Blog
             ================================================= -->

        <article>
            <h2>My First Blog</h2>

            <p>
                Today I started learning HTML. It is exciting to create
                webpages using headings, paragraphs, links, images,
                and other HTML elements.
            </p>
        </article>


        <!-- =================================================
             QUESTION 18: Aside - Useful Links
             ================================================= -->

        <aside>
            <h2>Useful Links</h2>

            <a href="https://www.google.com" target="_blank">
                Google
            </a>

            <br>

            <a href="https://www.github.com" target="_blank">
                GitHub
            </a>
        </aside>

    </main>


    <!-- =====================================================
         QUESTION 19: Footer section
         ===================================================== -->

    <footer>
        <p>
            &copy; 2026 Aryan Rastogi. All Rights Reserved.
        </p>
    </footer>


    <!-- =====================================================
         QUESTION 20: Complete webpage
         
         The complete webpage structure has been demonstrated
         using header, nav, main, section, article, aside,
         and footer elements.
         ===================================================== -->

</body>
</html>
